[2026-05-22 15:41:06] [INFO] [PostToolBatch] Input: {"session_id":"21866f7a-5a36-486a-a29d-86fc5a942cbe","transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\EDY\\.claude\\projects\\D--development-code-opencode-claude-hk\\21866f7a-5a36-486a-a29d-86fc5a942cbe.jsonl","cwd":"D:\\development\\code\\opencode\\claude-hk","permission_mode":"plan","agent_id":"a489671ed89314238","agent_type":"Explore","effort":{"level":"medium"},"hook_event_name":"PostToolBatch","tool_calls":[{"tool_name":"Read","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\development\\code\\opencode\\claude-hk\\README.md"},"tool_use_id":"call_c1b57ba0190547dfa48cc182","tool_response":"1\t# claude-hk\n2\t\n3\tClaude Code 配置与文档项目。为 Claude Code CLI 构建了一套完整的 Hooks 管道、Skill 技能系统和自动化初始化流程。\n4\t\n5\t## 快速开始\n6\t\n7\t1. 克隆仓库后用 Claude Code 打开\n8\t2. 首次启动自动执行初始化（创建目录、配置 Python、设置 UTF-8）\n9\t3. 使用 `/技能名` 调用内置 Skill\n10\t\n11\t## 项目结构\n12\t\n13\t```\n14\tclaude-hk/\n15\t├── .claude/                          # 自动化机制核心\n16\t│   ├── settings.json                 # 29 个生命周期事件声明\n17\t│   ├── init.sh                       # 首次运行统一初始化\n18\t│   ├── dirs.conf                     # 项目目录声明\n19\t│   ├── hooks/                        # Hooks 管道\n20\t│   │   ├── base.sh                   # 公共基础（JSON 解析、日志、输出）\n21\t│   │   ├── platform.sh               # 平台检测 + Python 路径解析\n22\t│   │   ├── json_get.py               # JSON 解析 Python 回退\n23\t│   │   ├── logs/                     # 按日期的 hook 日志\n24\t│   │   ├── 01-session-start/         # 会话启动：初始化 + 环境巡检\n25\t│   │   ├── 03-user-prompt-submit/    # 用户提交 prompt：Skill 注入\n26\t│   │   ├── 16-stop/                  # 响应完成：Skill 清理 + 自动注册\n27\t│   │   └── 02,04~29/                 # 其余事件（纯日志）\n28\t│   ├── scripts/\n29\t│   │   ├── ensure_dirs.sh            # 目录创建与检查\n30\t│   │   └── ensure_python.sh          # Python 环境保障（嵌入版/系统/自动下载）\n31\t│   ├── skills/                       # Skill 技能系统\n32\t│   │   ├── registry.conf             # 注册表\n33\t│   │   ├── active.sh                 # 运行时状态管理\n34\t│   │   ├── lock.sh                   # 并发文件锁\n35\t│   │   ├── log.sh                    # 双路日志模块\n36\t│   │   ├── 001-testcode-python/      # Python 测试脚本\n37\t│   │   ├── 002-otherdoc/             # 通用文档归档\n38\t│   │   ├── 003-issues/               # GitHub Issues 管理\n39\t│   │   ├── 004-git-push/             # 规范化 commit + push\n40\t│   │   └── 005-git-commit/           # 规范化 commit（仅本地）\n41\t│   └── myRule/                       # 用户自定义规则\n42\t├── .github/                          # GitHub 原生模板\n43\t│   ├── ISSUE_TEMPLATE/               # Issue 模板\n44\t│   └── PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE/        # PR 模板\n45\t├── claude-code-cli-doc/              # Claude Code 中文文档\n46\t├── doc/                              # Skills 运行时输出\n47\t│   ├── testcode/python/              # Python 脚本\n48\t│   ├── otherDoc/                     # 按日期归档的文档\n49\t│   └── issues/                       # Issue 草稿与模板\n50\t└── CLAUDE.md                         # 项目指令\n51\t```\n52\t\n53\t## 架构\n54\t\n55\t### 三层设计\n56\t\n57\t```\n58\tsettings.json（声明入口）\n59\t       │\n60\t       ▼\n61\tHooks 管道（29 个事件调度）\n62\t       │\n63\t       ▼\n64\tSkills 技能系统（5 个可扩展技能）\n65\t```\n66\t\n67\t### Hooks 管道\n68\t\n69\t`settings.json` 注册 29 个生命周期事件，每个事件指向 `XX-event-name/base.sh`。\n70\t\n71\t**公共基础设施** (`hooks/base.sh`)：\n72\t- `json_get(key)` — JSON 解析，三级降级：jq → Python → sed\n73\t- `log(level, msg)` — 结构化日志写入 `hooks/logs/YYYY-MM-DD.log`\n74\t- `hook_output(code, json)` — 标准退出（0=继续，2=阻止）\n75\t\n76\t**有业务逻辑的事件**：\n77\t\n78\t| 事件 | 触发时机 | 作用 |\n79\t|------|---------|------|\n80\t| 01-session-start | 每会话一次 | 首次初始化 + 每次环境巡检 |\n81\t| 03-user-prompt-submit | 每轮用户输入 | 检测 `/skill名`，匹配注册表，注入上下文 |\n82\t| 16-stop | 每轮响应完成 | 自动注册新 Skill + 清理活跃 Skill |\n83\t\n84\t**扩展方式**：在事件目录下新建 `.sh` 脚本，在 `base.sh` 中添加调用即可，无需改 `settings.json`。\n85\t\n86\t### 初始化流程\n87\t\n88\t**首次运行** (`init.sh`)：\n89\t\n90\t```\n91\t检测 .initialized 不存在\n92\t  → 1. 读取 dirs.conf 创建目录\n93\t  → 2. 平台检测 (Linux/macOS/Windows)\n94\t  → 3. Python 配置（嵌入版 → 系统 → 自动下载）\n95\t  → 4. UTF-8 配置（~/.bashrc 标记块，幂等）\n96\t  → 5. 写入 .initialized 标记\n97\t```\n98\t\n99\t**每次会话** (`01-session-start/base.sh`)：\n100\t\n101\t```\n102\tensure_utf8 → ensure_python_check → ensure_dirs\n103\t```\n104\t\n105\t### Skill 技能系统\n106\t\n107\t**生命周期**：\n108\t\n109\t```\n110\t用户输入 /skill-name\n111\t  → skill-inject.sh 匹配注册表\n112\t    → 运行 03UserPromptSubmit.sh（注入上下文到会话）\n113\t    → active_add(session_id, skill_name)\n114\t  → Claude 加载 SKILL.md 执行任务\n115\t  → Claude 完成 → 16Stop.sh 清理\n116\t    → active_remove(session_id)\n117\t```\n118\t\n119\t**自动注册**：`skill-register.sh` 在每次 Stop 事件时扫描 `skills/` 目录，发现新 Skill 自动追加到 `registry.conf`。\n120\t\n121\t**并发安全**：`lock.sh` 使用 `mkdir` 原子操作实现文件锁，保证 `.active` 文件的并发安全。\n122\t\n123\t**双路日志**：每个 Skill 的日志同时写入统一日志（`hooks/logs/`）和模块日志（`skills/log/<tag>/`）。\n124\t\n125\t## 内置 Skill\n126\t\n127\t| Skill | 命令 | 用途 |\n128\t|-------|------|------|\n129\t| `001-testcode-python` | `/001-testcode-python` | Python 测试脚本和 API 自动化 |\n130\t| `002-otherdoc` | `/002-otherdoc` | 按日期归档通用文档 |\n131\t| `003-issues` | `/003-issues` | GitHub Issue 草稿、模板、发布管理 |\n132\t| `004-git-push` | `/004-git-push` | 规范化 commit + push |\n133\t| `005-git-commit` | `/005-git-commit` | 规范化 commit（仅本地） |\n134\t\n135\t### Git 提交规范 (004/005)\n136\t\n137\t格式：`<type>: <主描述>` + `- 子描述`\n138\t\n139\tType：fix / feat / update / style / refactor / perf / test / docs / revert / build / chore\n140\t\n141\t分组优先级：type → 目录/模块 → 功能关联 → 影响范围。禁止 `git add .` 或 `git add -A`，必须按分组 add 具体文件。\n142\t\n143\t## 新增 Skill\n144\t\n145\t```\n146\t1. 创建 skills/XXX-name/ 目录\n147\t2. 编写 SKILL.md（frontmatter + 使用说明）\n148\t3. 编写 scripts/03UserPromptSubmit.sh（上下文注入）\n149\t4. 编写 scripts/16Stop.sh（清理）\n150\t5. 在 dirs.conf 中添加输出目录（如有）\n151\t6. 完成 — skill-register.sh 会自动注册\n152\t```\n153\t\n154\t## 设计亮点\n155\t\n156\t- **两层调度** — `base.sh` 只调度，业务脚本独立，扩展不改配置\n157\t- **自动注册** — 新 Skill 放入目录即被发现\n158\t- **渐进降级** — JSON: jq → Python → sed；Python: 嵌入版 → 系统 → 自动下载\n159\t- **幂等初始化** — 标记块防重复，状态文件持久化\n160\t- **并发安全** — mkdir 原子锁，僵尸锁自动清理\n161\t- **双路日志** — 全局 + 模块，便于排查\n162\t\n163\t## 文档\n164\t\n165\t- [Claude Code CLI 中文文档](claude-code-cli-doc/README.md)\n166\t- [Agent 技能体系](claude-code-cli-doc/Agent技能体系/)\n167\t- [Claude API 实战手册](claude-code-cli-doc/Claude-API实战手册/)\n168\t- [Claude Code 使用指南](claude-code-cli-doc/Claude-Code使用指南/)\n169\t- [Claude Code 源码分析](claude-code-cli-doc/Claude-Code源码分析/)\n170\t\n171\t## Open Issues\n172\t\n173\t- [#1](https://github.com/xiaoheiDTF/claude-hk/issues/1) — 16-stop .active 只增不删 bug\n174\t- [#2](https://github.com/xiaoheiDTF/claude-hk/issues/2) — 优化 003-issues Skill 闭环\n175\t- [#3](https://github.com/xiaoheiDTF/claude-hk/issues/3) — Skill 级 init.sh / init_check.sh\n176\t"},{"tool_name":"Read","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\development\\code\\opencode\\claude-hk\\CLAUDE.md"},"tool_use_id":"call_87ceaaf52f944ed9b61e0a0c","tool_response":"1\t# CLAUDE.md\n2\t\n3\tThis file provides guidance to Claude Code (claude.ai/code) when working with code in this repository.\n4\t\n5\t## Project Overview\n6\t\n7\tClaude Code configuration and documentation project. Contains no application code — the repo provides a hooks system, custom skills, and Chinese-translated Claude Code documentation.\n8\t\n9\t## Directory Structure\n10\t\n11\t```\n12\tclaude-hk/\n13\t├── .claude/\n14\t│   ├── .initialized                    # 首次运行标记文件（JSON：os/python/utf8/时间）\n15\t│   ├── dirs.conf                       # 项目目录声明（ensure_dirs.sh 读取此文件）\n16\t│   ├── init.sh                         # 首次运行统一初始化（目录、Python、UTF-8）\n17\t│   ├── settings.json                   # Hooks 配置（全部 29 个生命周期事件）\n18\t│   ├── settings.local.json             # 本地权限白名单\n19\t│   ├── hooks/\n20\t│   │   ├── base.sh                     # 所有 hook 的公共基础：JSON 读取、日志、输出\n21\t│   │   ├── platform.sh                 # 平台检测（linux/macos/windows）+ Python 路径解析\n22\t│   │   ├── json_get.py                 # 无 jq 时的 JSON 解析回退\n23\t│   │   ├── logs/                       # 按日期的 hook 日志（YYYY-MM-DD.log）\n24\t│   │   ├── 01-session-start/base.sh    # 会话启动：首次→init.sh，每次→UTF-8/Python/目录检查\n25\t│   │   ├── 03-user-prompt-submit/\n26\t│   │   │   ├── base.sh                 # 调度器：调用 skill-inject.sh 注入上下文\n27\t│   │   │   └── skill-inject.sh         # 匹配 /技能名，查 registry.conf，运行 on_load.sh 注入上下文\n28\t│   │   ├── 02,04~29/base.sh            # 其余生命周期 hook（纯日志记录，暂无其他脚本）\n29\t│   │   ├── registry.conf               # Skill 注册表（skill-inject.sh 读取此文件匹配）\n30\t│   ├── scripts/\n31\t│   │   └── ensure_dirs.sh              # 读取 dirs.conf 创建/检查目录\n32\t│   ├── skills/\n33\t│   │   ├── log.sh                      # Skill 统一日志模块（skill_log 函数）\n34\t│   │   ├── log/                        # Skill 日志目录\n35\t│   │   ├── 001-testcode-python/\n36\t│   │   │   ├── SKILL.md                # Python 测试脚本 skill 定义\n37\t│   │   │   └── scripts/on_load.sh, run.sh\n38\t│   │   ├── 002-otherdoc/\n39\t│   │   │   ├── SKILL.md                # 文档归档 skill 定义\n40\t│   │   │   └── scripts/on_load.sh\n41\t│   │   ├── 003-1-issue-init/           # 初始化 issue 标签体系\n42\t│   │   ├── 003-2-issue/                # 创建 GitHub Issue\n43\t│   │   ├── 003-3-issue-discuss/        # 拉取 Issue 内容讨论\n44\t│   │   ├── 003-4-issue-claim/          # 原子领取 Issue\n45\t│   │   ├── 003-5-issue-fix/            # 根据 issue 创建分支\n46\t│   │   ├── 003-6-issue-done/           # 标记开发完成\n47\t│   │   ├── 003-7-issue-pr/             # 创建 PR 关联 issue\n48\t│   │   ├── 003-8-issue-test/           # 执行 PR Test Plan\n49\t│   │   ├── 003-9-issue-review/         # 审核合并或打回\n50\t│   │   ├── 004-git-push/\n51\t│   │   │   ├── SKILL.md                # 提交并推送 skill 定义\n52\t│   │   │   └── scripts/on_load.sh\n53\t│   │   └── 005-git-commit/\n54\t│   │       ├── SKILL.md                # 仅提交 skill 定义\n55\t│   │       └── scripts/on_load.sh\n56\t│   └── myRule/                         # 用户自定义规则（手动维护，不自动注入）\n57\t├── claude-code-cli-doc/                # Claude Code 中文文档\n58\t│   ├── README.md                       # 文档索引\n59\t│   ├── 01~09                           # 官方文档中文翻译（CLI/命令/环境变量/工具/交互/Hooks/Plugins/Channels）\n60\t│   ├── Agent技能体系/                  # Agent skill 体系文档\n61\t│   ├── Claude-API实战手册/             # Claude API 实战手册\n62\t│   ├── Claude-Code使用指南/            # Claude Code 使用指南\n63\t│   └── Claude-Code源码分析/            # Claude Code 源码分析\n64\t├── doc/                                # Skills 运行时输出目录\n65\t│   ├── testcode/python/api/            # Python API 自动化测试脚本\n66\t│   ├── testcode/python/other/          # Python 其他脚本\n67\t│   ├── otherDoc/YYYY-MM-DD/            # 按日期归档的文档\n68\t│   └── issues/\n69\t│       ├── drafts/                     # Issues 本地草稿\n70\t│       └── templates/                  # Issues 可复用模板\n71\t├── .gitignore\n72\t└── CLAUDE.md\n73\t```\n74\t\n75\t## Architecture\n76\t\n77\t### Hooks Pipeline\n78\t\n79\t**两层架构：`base.sh`（调度器）+ 同目录下的其他脚本（业务逻辑）**\n80\t\n81\t每个数字编号的 hook 目录（`01-session-start/` ~ `29-session-end/`）都遵循同一模式：\n82\t\n83\t```\n84\tXX-event-name/\n85\t├── base.sh            # 入口，由 settings.json 调用\n86\t├── other-script.sh    # base.sh 调用的具体业务脚本（可选）\n87\t└── ...\n88\t```\n89\t\n90\t1. **`base.sh` 是调度器** — `settings.json` 中每个事件只指向 `base.sh`。`base.sh` 先 source 公共的 `hooks/base.sh`（提供 JSON stdin 读取、`json_get()` 解析、结构化日志、`hook_output()` 输出），然后调用同目录下的其他 `.sh` 脚本来执行具体业务逻辑。目前只有 `01-session-start` 和 `03-user-prompt-submit` 的 `base.sh` 有额外调度逻辑，其余（`02`、`04`~`29`）都是纯日志记录。\n91\t2. **同目录下的其他 `.sh` 是实际逻辑** — 目前只有 `03-user-prompt-submit/skill-inject.sh` 一个：它从用户 prompt 中提取 `/技能名`，在 `skills/registry.conf` 注册表中查找匹配，找到后运行对应 skill 的 `on_load.sh`，将输出作为 `additionalContext` 注入会话。这些脚本由 `base.sh` 调度执行，不是独立运行的。\n92\t3. **扩展方式** — 给某个事件加新功能时，在该事件目录下新建 `.sh` 脚本，然后在 `base.sh` 中添加调用即可。不需要改 `settings.json`。\n93\t\n94\t**公共基础设施**（`hooks/base.sh`）：\n95\t- JSON stdin 读取 → `json_get()` 解析（jq 优先，回退到 `json_get.py` via Python）\n96\t- 日志写入 `.claude/hooks/logs/YYYY-MM-DD.log`，格式 `[timestamp] [LEVEL] [EventName]`\n97\t- `hook_output()` 封装退出码和结果 JSON\n98\t\n99\t**平台检测**（`hooks/platform.sh`）：通过 `uname -s` 检测 OS，解析 Python 路径（优先嵌入版 `.claude/localLanguage/python/python.exe`，回退到系统 `python3`/`python`）。\n100\t\n101\t### Initialization Flow\n102\t\n103\tFirst session: `01-session-start/base.sh` detects `.initialized` is missing → runs `init.sh` which:\n104\t1. Reads `dirs.conf` and creates all declared directories\n105\t2. Detects platform and sets up Python (downloads embeddable Python on Windows)\n106\t3. Configures UTF-8 in `~/.bashrc` (with idempotent marker guards)\n107\t4. Writes `.initialized` marker with environment info\n108\t\n109\tEvery subsequent session: `01-session-start/base.sh` re-checks UTF-8, Python availability, and directory integrity.\n110\t\n111\t### Skill System\n112\t\n113\tSkills are numbered (`001-` through `005-`) for load-order. Each skill目录结构：\n114\t\n115\t```\n116\tXXX-skill-name/\n117\t├── SKILL.md                # Skill 定义（frontmatter: name/description/allowed-tools + 使用说明）\n118\t└── scripts/\n119\t    ├── on_load.sh          # 上下文注入脚本（Skill 被调用时自动执行）\n120\t    └── run.sh              # 执行脚本（可选，部分 skill 有）\n121\t```\n122\t\n123\t**`on_load.sh` 的作用：前置上下文注入。** 当用户提交包含 `/技能名` 的 prompt 时，`03-user-prompt-submit/base.sh` 调用 `skill-inject.sh`，后者从用户输入中提取 `/技能名`，在 `skills/registry.conf` 中查找匹配 → 找到后运行对应 skill 的 `scripts/on_load.sh` → 将 stdout 作为 `additionalContext` 注入到当前会话。`on_load.sh` 动态输出环境信息（日期、目录、Python 版本、git 分支等），让 Skill 执行时拥有更准确的上下文。\n124\t\n125\t**新增 Skill 时需要两步注册：**\n126\t1. 在 `skills/` 下创建目录和 `SKILL.md` + `scripts/on_load.sh`\n127\t2. 在 `skills/registry.conf` 中添加一行（`skill-inject.sh` 依赖此文件匹配）\n128\t\n129\t**完整调用链：**\n130\t```\n131\t用户提交包含 /技能名 的 prompt\n132\t  → settings.json 触发 UserPromptSubmit 事件\n133\t    → 03-user-prompt-submit/base.sh（调度器）\n134\t      → skill-inject.sh（提取 /技能名，查 registry.conf）\n135\t        → 对应 skill 的 scripts/on_load.sh（生成上下文）\n136\t          → stdout 作为 additionalContext 注入会话\n137\t            → Skill 正式执行（SKILL.md 中的指令）\n138\t```\n139\t\n140\tDirectory requirements are centralized in `.claude/dirs.conf` — `ensure_dirs.sh` reads it to create or verify directories.\n141\t\n142\t### Skills Summary\n143\t\n144\t| Skill | Output Directory | Purpose |\n145\t|-------|-----------------|---------|\n146\t| `001-testcode-python` | `doc/testcode/python/{api,other}/` | Python test scripts and utilities |\n147\t| `002-otherdoc` | `doc/otherDoc/YYYY-MM-DD/` | General documentation by date |\n148\t| `003-1-issue-init` | — | 初始化 issue 标签体系（一次性） |\n149\t| `003-2-issue` | `doc/issues/{drafts,templates}/` | 创建 GitHub Issue |\n150\t| `003-3-issue-discuss` | — | 拉取 Issue 内容进行讨论 |\n151\t| `003-4-issue-claim` | — | 原子领取 Issue |\n152\t| `003-5-issue-fix` | — | 根据 issue 创建分支并开始开发 |\n153\t| `003-6-issue-done` | — | 标记开发完成，准备提 PR |\n154\t| `003-7-issue-pr` | — | 创建 PR 关联 issue |\n155\t| `003-8-issue-test` | — | 执行 PR 的 Test Plan |\n156\t| `003-9-issue-review` | — | 审核合并或打回 PR |\n157\t| `004-git-push` | — | Commit (grouped, Chinese messages) + push |\n158\t| `005-git-commit` | — | Commit only (grouped, Chinese messages), no push |\n159\t\n160\t## Git Commit Convention (Skills 004/005)\n161\t\n162\tAll commits use Chinese: `<type>: <主描述>` with `- 具体修改描述` sub-items.\n163\t\n164\tTypes: fix/feat/update/style/refactor/perf/test/docs/revert/build/chore\n165\t\n166\tGrouping priority: type → directory/module → functional association → impact scope. Never `git add .` or `git add -A` — always add specific files by group.\n167\t\n168\t\n169\t# CLAUDE.md\n170\t\n171\tBehavioral guidelines to reduce common LLM coding mistakes. Merge with project-specific instructions as needed.\n172\t\n173\t**Tradeoff:** These guidelines bias toward caution over speed. For trivial tasks, use judgment.\n174\t\n175\t## 1. Think Before Coding\n176\t\n177\t**Don't assume. Don't hide confusion. Surface tradeoffs.**\n178\t\n179\tBefore implementing:\n180\t- State your assumptions explicitly. If uncertain, ask.\n181\t- If multiple interpretations exist, present them - don't pick silently.\n182\t- If a simpler approach exists, say so. Push back when warranted.\n183\t- If something is unclear, stop. Name what's confusing. Ask.\n184\t\n185\t## 2. Simplicity First\n186\t\n187\t**Minimum code that solves the problem. Nothing speculative.**\n188\t\n189\t- No features beyond what was asked.\n190\t- No abstractions for single-use code.\n191\t- No \"flexibility\" or \"configurability\" that wasn't requested.\n192\t- No error handling for impossible scenarios.\n193\t- If you write 200 lines and it could be 50, rewrite it.\n194\t\n195\tAsk yourself: \"Would a senior engineer say this is overcomplicated?\" If yes, simplify.\n196\t\n197\t## 3. Surgical Changes\n198\t\n199\t**Touch only what you must. Clean up only your own mess.**\n200\t\n201\tWhen editing existing code:\n202\t- Don't \"improve\" adjacent code, comments, or formatting.\n203\t- Don't refactor things that aren't broken.\n204\t- Match existing style, even if you'd do it differently.\n205\t- If you notice unrelated dead code, mention it - don't delete it.\n206\t\n207\tWhen your changes create orphans:\n208\t- Remove imports/variables/functions that YOUR changes made unused.\n209\t- Don't remove pre-existing dead code unless asked.\n210\t\n211\tThe test: Every changed line should trace directly to the user's request.\n212\t\n213\t## 4. Goal-Driven Execution\n214\t\n215\t**Define success criteria. Loop until verified.**\n216\t\n217\tTransform tasks into verifiable goals:\n218\t- \"Add validation\" → \"Write tests for invalid inputs, then make them pass\"\n219\t- \"Fix the bug\" → \"Write a test that reproduces it, then make it pass\"\n220\t- \"Refactor X\" → \"Ensure tests pass before and after\"\n221\t\n222\tFor multi-step tasks, state a brief plan:\n223\t```\n224\t1. [Step] → verify: [check]\n225\t2. [Step] → verify: [check]\n226\t3. [Step] → verify: [check]\n227\t```\n228\t\n229\tStrong success criteria let you loop independently. Weak criteria (\"make it work\") require constant clarification.\n230\t\n231\t---\n232\t\n233\t**These guidelines are working if:** fewer unnecessary changes in diffs, fewer rewrites due to overcomplication, and clarifying questions come before implementation rather than after mistakes."},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_input":{"command":"ls -la \"D:/development/code/opencode/claude-hk/doc/\" 2>/dev/null; echo \"---\"; ls -la \"D:/development/code/opencode/claude-hk/docs/\" 2>/dev/null","description":"List doc/ and docs/ directory contents"},"tool_use_id":"call_46498f9f296a4fbd9418d9ab","tool_response":"Exit code 2\ntotal 4\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 EDY 197121 0  5月 22 10:14 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 EDY 197121 0  5月 22 12:55 ..\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 EDY 197121 0  5月 22 10:14 issues\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 EDY 197121 0  5月 22 10:14 otherDoc\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 EDY 197121 0  5月 22 10:14 testcode\n---"},{"tool_name":"Glob","tool_input":{"pattern":".github/**/*","path":"D:\\development\\code\\opencode\\claude-hk"},"tool_use_id":"call_ac8242bb441042229b2a9dac","tool_response":".github\\DISCUSSION_TEMPLATE\\ideas.yml\n.github\\ISSUE_TEMPLATE\\bug-report.md\n.github\\ISSUE_TEMPLATE\\bug_report.yml\n.github\\ISSUE_TEMPLATE\\config.yml\n.github\\ISSUE_TEMPLATE\\feature-request.md\n.github\\ISSUE_TEMPLATE\\feature_request.yml\n.github\\PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE\\default.md"},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_input":{"command":"ls -la \"D:/development/code/opencode/claude-hk/LICENSE\" 2>/dev/null; echo \"EXIT:$?\"","description":"Check if LICENSE file exists"},"tool_use_id":"call_ed9a3e742a7e4700a287ad1a","tool_response":"EXIT:2"}]}
