      # Issue/PR/Discussion 模板\n├── claude-code-cli-doc/    # Claude Code 中文文档（130+ 篇）\n├── doc/                    # 文档 + Skill 运行时输出\n└── CLAUDE.md               # Claude Code 项目指令\n```\n\n详细结构解析见 [目录结构文档](doc/mechanisms/project-structure.md)。\n\n## 许可证\n\nMIT License\n"},"tool_use_id":"call_c1f8634e8d3b4933bcc1e1ac","tool_response":"The file D:\\development\\code\\opencode\\claude-hk\\README.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]}
